# Generated pod inventory from scripts/runpod/create_pods.sh — specific pod
# ids/hostnames, stale the moment a pod is torn down. pods.conf* files (the
# actual launch recipe: image, GPU type, disk size) ARE committed, for
# reproducibility of short-lived pods.
scripts/runpod/hosts.generated.csv
scripts/runpod/hosts.generated.yaml